  "published": "2026-11-05T14:47:24.85Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.2.0:\n\t\t\t- New: exact Contains / StartsWith / EndsWith search on encrypted columns through a keyed search index (HasSearchIndex, AsEncrypted). The key is never sent to the database.\n\t\t\t- New: in-application sorting of encrypted columns with a chosen culture and null placement. A required maxRows cap makes it throw instead of truncating.\n\t\t\t- New: query guard (UseEncryptedQueryGuard). Queries that cannot work on ciphertext throw EncryptedQueryNotSupportedException instead of silently returning zero rows or a scrambled order.\n\t\t\t- New: per-column normalization (WithNormalization), SearchIndexBackfill for existing rows, and EncryptionRotator for verified, resumable batch re-encryption (CBC to GCM, key rotation).\n\t\t\t- Fixed: MigrationCryptoProvider could fail to read about 1 in 256 legacy AES-CBC values whose first bytes looked like a GCM envelope with an unregistered key ID.\n\t\t\t- Tested on SQLite, PostgreSQL 16, MySQL 8.4 and SQL Server 2022. See docs/SEARCH_AND_REENCRYPTION.md for limits and measured performance.\n\t\t\tRoadmap: https://github.com/efcore-encryption/EntityFrameworkCore.Crypto.DataEncryption/blob/main/ROADMAP.md",
